221	<body>
222	<div class="wrap">
223	  <header class="hero">
224	    <div class="eyebrow">Reusable Components · MewGuard UX Assets</div>
225	    <h1>MewGuard — a sentimental-design asset kit</h1>
226	    <p class="lede">
227	      A series of <b>non-functional</b> illustrations and animated assets for <b>MewGuard</b>, the app that helps
228	      cat owners check whether a substance is toxic to their cat. They render no data and gate no flow — their only
229	      job is to carry the <i>feeling</i> of each moment: an anxious owner deserves calm, a clear verdict deserves warmth,
230	      and an emergency deserves a steady hand. Each asset maps to one moment in the MewGuard journey, with the
